  "content": "\n\n<p>這款小巧的（Neo-）Forge 模組讓您可以透過簡單配方合成火藥，所需材料為螢石粉、紅石粉、打火石與（燒）煤。在合成桌或背包快捷合成欄中，這些物品的排列順序皆可任意調整。</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftable-gunpowder-recipe/files/6404324\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.1 版本下載直鏈。</a></strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_81c291e3-b041-4fe0-96e8-f9a02b7fcaed.gif\" width=\"495\" height=\"129\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_951eff1b-825f-46ed-993f-d7416790490a.png\" width=\"494\" height=\"494\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>下載：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>NeoForge\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftable-gunpowder-recipe/files/7974555\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>26.1.2</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftable-gunpowder-recipe/files/7974549\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">26.1.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftable-gunpowder-recipe/files/7974543\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">26.1&nbsp;</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftable-gunpowder-recipe/files/7626203\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.11</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftable-gunpowder-recipe/files/7626200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.10</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftable-gunpowder-recipe/files/7635371\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftable-gunpowder-recipe/files/7626195\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftable-gunpowder-recipe/files/7626194\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/mi